HackerEarth 2026 Dataset

The raw zerve_hackathon_dataset.csv is proprietary and NOT included in this
repository. Only aggregate results are included in data/snt_asi_scores.csv
and data/snt_corpus_final.csv. Contact elan.zainos.corona@gmail.com for
collaboration requests involving the raw dataset.

